# Reproducibility is the product claim (AGENTS.md rule 17: one source of truth
# per fact, canonical-JSON key order, digest rules). Line endings are a fact
# about the bytes, so they are pinned rather than left to each contributor's
# core.autocrlf. A Windows clone must hash identically to a Linux clone.
* text=auto eol=lf

# Never rewrite these; they are byte-significant by construction.
bun.lock -text
data/** -text
*.db -text
*.db-shm -text
*.db-wal -text
*.png -text
*.jpg -text
*.woff2 -text
